WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.540
Mr Haris Jiva, hello.

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:02.300
Hello.

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:03.040
How are you?

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:04.400
I'm well, thank God. And you?

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:06.480
Thank God, thank you, we're well too.

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:09.840
First of all, thank you very much
for having us and hosting us.

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:12.700
Let's hand over to Mr Haris
and get to know you.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:15.380
My name is Haris Jiva, and I'm from Pakistan.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.540
I came to Türkiye in 2012
and founded three companies.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.620
First, I graduated here,
from Antalya Bilim University.

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:23.900
I studied Industrial Engineering.

00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:28.900
Then I founded an education consultancy
for studying abroad, called UniAdmire.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:31.420
I started bringing international
students from abroad.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:34.000
Then, step by step,
I moved into the construction sector.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:38.780
And two years ago I opened the private
employment agency JobsAdmire.

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:45.440
We bring workers from abroad, from different
countries in Central Asia and Africa,
and place them with factories here.

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:49.140
When you look at it,
you're in a difficult field.

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:51.420
There's serious effort behind the scenes.

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:53.260
What do you owe this success to?

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:58.600
This success… our connections abroad
were easier, and I also spoke English.

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:00.900
I can build connections more easily.

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:03.100
I saw there was a big gap
in this sector in Türkiye.

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:06.060
We can't find the right staff.

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:11.600
We also built a portal to create
opportunities for students abroad.

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:14.660
We've put a lot of effort into this sector.

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:17.140
I imagine you've seen a lot of demand.

00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:22.320
Also, Turkish TV series started
airing abroad a lot.

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:24.740
Once they did, many people
wanted to come to Türkiye.

00:01:24.740 --> 00:01:26.340
That's why we kept going down this road.

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:27.760
We started with students.

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:29.800
Then we started bringing in workers too.

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:32.700
In fact, you've achieved empathy.

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:39.840
Starting from the problems you faced yourself,
you set out to be a bridge for people here.

00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:40.960
And you've achieved it.

00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:42.580
Congratulations on that.

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:48.020
To grow even bigger,
we've also started a mobile app.

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:48.720
How so?

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:52.100
Let me give you an example:
you own a factory.

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:53.760
You need workers from abroad.

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:57.720
In our mobile app you can review
50 or 100 CVs directly.

00:01:58.620 --> 00:02:01.720
You choose from there, and we can give
you suggestions with AI.

00:02:02.700 --> 00:02:06.960
You interview them,
and we handle all the procedures.

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:10.400
So you've really taken on
the whole workload.

00:02:10.420 --> 00:02:11.980
Think of it like this.

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:13.440
Think of Kariyer.net.

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:15.500
Kariyer.net has staff listings too.

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:17.120
In our app,
they will be from abroad.

00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:21.140
In some sectors it's hard to find workers.

00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:24.600
Especially agriculture
and marble factories.

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:27.480
Finding qualified staff
is really very hard now.

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:28.940
Exactly, that's very hard too.

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:32.040
But with our app,
the procedure will be even easier.

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:35.820
In fact everyone wins here:
the employer is very happy.

00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:38.620
The people who will work here
are very happy too.

00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:40.540
They actually start a new life here.

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:42.640
Yes, and think how much
it supports their families.

00:02:42.740 --> 00:02:48.020
When we place a worker,
we're also supporting their family.

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:51.420
You must feel the pride
and joy of that.

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:52.240
Of course.

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:54.040
Last question:
are you where you aimed to be?

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:55.000
Yes.

00:02:55.160 --> 00:03:01.060
My goal is to develop this app further
and connect it with more factories.

00:03:01.420 --> 00:03:05.500
My aim is to operate not only in Türkiye,
but in other countries as well.

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:08.140
And I'm very happy living in Türkiye.

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:09.180
How lovely.

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:10.300
It was a very warm conversation.

00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:12.280
Thank you very much, sir.

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:15.440
With your permission, we'd like to invite
everyone to your office.

00:03:15.780 --> 00:03:19.000
Let them come, see it
and hear about the projects.

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:22.260
Have a cup of tea or coffee
and get to know you.

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:22.960
Of course.

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:25.280
See you in other programmes. Goodbye.
